sition to help  crush the world government or at least  to change it from within we know zoro  has to be related to his lookalike  shimotsuki ushimaru who has a similar  fighting style similar appearance and  the list goes on ushimaru was shown in  the anime wearing a cloak with a bull on  it and the bull was black and green so  there is a clear connection there with  green bull and thus there's a clear  connection with green bull and zoro now  for just the similarities between zorro  and green bull morge actually in his  video made a good point that zorro and  green bull were introduced in similar  ways zoro was fasting when luffy met him  and greenbell is fasting when he's  introduced he even tells fujitora he  hasn't eaten in three years but he might  if a gal fed him and in zorro's case he  did eat the rice balls the girl brought  him near the beginning of the story now  green bull says eating is a pain to him  and he hasn't eaten for three years  which seems super human as if it's a  fruit power thing rather than just a  fast but these parallels shouldn't be  ignored either way foregoing eating has  been associated with one of specific  characters like ushimaru and zorro so  it's another point that lends weight to  greenville being from wano just as his  friend fujitora clearly appears to be  now that green bull is coming and since  we just had a focus on sanji and his  father last arc it seems more likely  than ever that zorro during this arc of  his will now have to confront his own  dad since luffy usopp and sanji already  have famous living dads it's even more  likely that zorro's dad will be someone  important and living like green bull i  also haven't mentioned the obvious yet  that zoro is associated with the color  green more than any other but it's still  a fact that shouldn't be ignored when  looking at green bull and his connection  to zorro the other cool thing is if  zoro's dad is green bull as i believe he  probably is then all four of these  mentioned dads will be powerful people  from different areas of life one being a  revolutionary one a pirate one an  admiral and one a king scientist so yeah  this is big news whether you think  greenville is zorro's dad or not because  he is nonetheless a character shattered  mystery and an admiral to boot so you  can bet he's gonna be interesting to  watch and to learn about regardless of  his relationship to zorro let me know  what you think since the truth will come  out soon place your bets for bragging  rights in the comments is green bull  zoro's father or not and while you're at  it how do you think he could go three  years without eating is it fruit powers  as i think it is or do you think you can  take samurai epicness so far that that's  actually possible once you reach a  certain level at least in the world of  one piece could fasting be seen as green  bulls version of fujitora blinding  himself and will greenville attack and  fight the straw hats or actually allow  them to escape revealing that he's  actually on their side and if this is  zoro's dad just as last arc dealt with  sanji's dad will it be an even further  clue that as i've been expecting luffy's  dad will play a bigger role in the next  arc since now as the worry of liberation  sun god luffy seems to be integral to  dragon's revolutionary mission yes i  have a lot of questions but one thing we  don't need to question one thing we know  for certain and that one thing is you  should smash that like button and set  off the wano fireworks if you enjoyed  this video and want to see more like it  if you haven't make this the video you  joined the nakama by subscribing and  hitting that notification bell to turn  on all notifications or you will miss  future one-piece videos and updates  while you wait for the full translated  pages review to come out feel free to  check out my huge and growing one-piece  playlist that includes videos on all  yonko warlords supernova mythical zones  oh yeah and admiral